	<digest>
		Antialiased half wave signal rectifier
	</digest>
	<description>
		<b>evi.rectify~</b> is a 'max define' for the <o>evi_rectify</o>.gendsp gen~ abstraction.
		Because evi.rectify~ is a 'max define' it also accepts all messages and attributes that a <o>gen~</o> object does. <br />
		<br />
		<o>evi.rectify~</o> is a simple passive audio signal rectifer. Rectification waveshapes an audio signal so that only positive vallues remain in the output giving a digital distorted effect. <o>evi.rectify~</o> is antialiased via anti derivative antialiasing and dcblocked, so that the resulting signal is cleaner and softer than a mathematical rectification. <br />
	</description>
